&lt;li style=&quot; font-size:9pt;&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;协议：GPL / LGPL&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot; font-size:9pt;&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;matplotlib&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; -qt-list-indent: 2;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot; font-size:9pt;&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;用途：数据可视化，负责柱状图、饼图、折线图等统计分析图表的生成。&lt;/li&gt;
